 e Moon sets during the occultation: only the disappearance is above the ho
 rizon.\nThe Moon is 10° up in the WNW · daylight\, Sun +63°.\nTimes aga
 inst the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: 
 https://occult.alokm.com/jupiter-2026-10-06?city=Lusaka%2C%20ZM
